    rdfs:comment "Used to resolve application settings (e.g. BackgroundColor, ForegroundColor, Layout customization, etc) SMART TABLE. Key fields (8): Key, UserAccount, PrimaryRole, Facility, Area, Step, Resource, ResourceProcessingType. Mandatory: Key. 23 precedence rule(s) published. Subclass of cm:SmartTableContext." .

