    cm:verdict "vendor-extension" ;
    cm:sourceDoc "tables/smart-tables/stepinspectionplancontext" ;
    rdfs:comment "The association between the Step and the Inspection Plan is established via context SMART TABLE. Key fields (12): Step, LogicalFlowPath, InspectionSeverity, Product, ProductGroup, Flow, Material, MaterialType, ProductionOrder, Resource, ResourceType, Model. Mandatory: Step, InspectionPlan, InspectionPlanConfiguration. 47 precedence rule(s) published. Subclass of cm:SmartTableContext." .

cm:StepLineFlowContext a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf cm:DataObject ; rdfs:label "Step Line Flow Context" ;
    cm:verdict "vendor-extension" ;
    cm:sourceDoc "tables/smart-tables/steplineflowcontext" ;
    rdfs:comment "The association between the Step and the Line Flow is established via context. SMART TABLE. Key fields (7): Step, Product, ProductGroup, Flow, Resource, ResourceType, Model. Mandatory: Step, LineFlow, LineValidationMode, LineAssemblyMode. 14 precedence rule(s) published. Subclass of cm:SmartTableContext." .

cm:StepProductYieldAndCycleTimeContext a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf cm:DataObject ; rdfs:label "Step Product Yield And Cycle Time Context" ;
    cm:verdict "vendor-extension" ;
    cm:sourceDoc "tables/smart-tables/stepproductyieldandcycletimecontext" ;
    rdfs:comment "Used to resolve the Yield and Cycle Time for a specific Product Context SMART TABLE. Key fields (4): Step, Product, ProductGroup, Flow. Mandatory: Step, Yield. 5 precedence rule(s) published. Subclass of cm:SmartTableContext." .

cm:StepReworkLimitsContext a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf cm:DataObject ; rdfs:label "Step Rework Limits Context" ;
    cm:verdict "vendor-extension" ;
    cm:sourceDoc "tables/smart-tables/stepreworklimitscontext" ;
    rdfs:comment "Used to define Step Rework Limits Context. SMART TABLE. Key fields (8): Step, LogicalFlowPath, Product, ProductGroup, Flow, MaterialType, ProductionOrder, Material. Mandatory: Step, ReworkLimit. 19 precedence rule(s) published. Subclass of cm:SmartTableContext." .

cm:StepSamplingPatternContext a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf cm:DataObject ; rdfs:label "Step Sampling Pattern Context" ;
    cm:verdict "vendor-extension" ;
    cm:sourceDoc "tables/smart-tables/stepsamplingpatterncontext" ;
    rdfs:comment "The association between the Step and the SamplingPattern us established via context SMART TABLE. Key fields (10): Step, LogicalFlowPath, Product, ProductGroup, Flow, Material, MaterialType, Resource, ResourceType, Model. Mandatory: Step, SamplingPattern. 29 precedence rule(s) published. Subclass of cm:SmartTableContext." .

cm:StepSplitTrackOutContext a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf cm:DataObject ; rdfs:label "Step Split Track Out Context" ;
    cm:verdict "vendor-extension" ;
    cm:sourceDoc "tables/smart-tables/stepsplittrackoutcontext" ;
    rdfs:comment "Used to resolve some information for the split and track-out operation. SMART TABLE. Key fields (7): Step, Product, ProductGroup, Flow, Resource, ResourceType, Model. Mandatory: Step, EnableQuantityOverride, TrackOutMaterialMode, MaterialLossesMode. 14 precedence rule(s) published. Subclass of cm:SmartTableContext." .

cm:TimeConstraintsContext a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf cm:DataObject ; rdfs:label "Time Constraints Context" ;
    cm:verdict "vendor-extension" ;
    cm:sourceDoc "tables/smart-tables/timeconstraintscontext" ;
    rdfs:comment "Used to resolve the Time Constraints. SMART TABLE. Key fields (9): FromStep, FromLogicalFlowPath, FromOperation, FromFlow, Product, ProductGroup, Manufacturer, Material, MaterialType. Mandatory: FromStep, FromOperation, ToStep, ToOperation, Type, MultiplicationFactor, TimeLimit, RemoveOnPass. 19 precedence rule(s) published. Subclass of cm:SmartTableContext." .

cm:UIPageContext a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf cm:DataObject ; rdfs:label "U I Page Context" ;
    cm:verdict "vendor-extension" ;
    cm:sourceDoc "tables/smart-tables/uipagecontext" ;
    rdfs:comment "Used to resolve UIPage Exceptions for UI Actions (e.g. Material.Trackin for a specific context) SMART TABLE. Key fields (7): Action, PrimaryRole, Facility, Area, Step, Resource, ResourceProcessingType. Mandatory: Action. 12 precedence rule(s) published. Subclass of cm:SmartTableContext." .

cm:GenerativeAIPrompt a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf cm:DataObject ; rdfs:label "Generative A I Prompt" ;
    cm:verdict "vendor-extension" ;
    cm:sourceDoc "tables/smart-tables/generativeaiprompt" ;
    rdfs:comment "SmartTable to map the prompt prefix for a specific GenerativeAI Action and EntityType to use as context for the LLM SMART TABLE (configuration, not context resolution). Key fields: EntityType, PromptId, Model." .

cm:ProductComponentMapping a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf cm:DataObject ; rdfs:label "Product Component Mapping" ;
    cm:verdict "vendor-extension" ;
    cm:sourceDoc "tables/smart-tables/productcomponentmapping" ;
    rdfs:comment "This generic table is used to store Product Component mapping information to assist in correcting imported BOMs internal part numbers. SMART TABLE (configuration, not context resolution). Key fields: InternalPartNumber, Manufacturer, ManufacturerPartNumber." .

cm:ResourceCapacity a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf cm:DataObject ; rdfs:label "Resource Capacity" ;
    cm:verdict "vendor-extension" ;
    cm:sourceDoc "tables/smart-tables/resourcecapacity" ;
    rdfs:comment "Resources of SchedulingType: Batch and Tunnel. SMART TABLE (configuration, not context resolution). Key fields: Resource, ResourceType, Model." .

cm:ResourceIdealCycleTime a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf cm:DataObject ; rdfs:label "Resource Ideal Cycle Time" ;
    cm:verdict "vendor-extension" ;
    cm:sourceDoc "tables/smart-tables/resourceidealcycletime" ;
    rdfs:comment "The machine supplier provided unit cycle time. SMART TABLE (configuration, not context resolution). Key fields: Resource, ResourceType, Model, Step, Product, ProductGroup." .

cm:ResourceProcessTime a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf cm:DataObject ; rdfs:label "Resource Process Time" ;
    cm:verdict "vendor-extension" ;
    cm:sourceDoc "tables/smart-tables/resourceprocesstime" ;
    rdfs:comment "Resource Process Times is used for Scheduling purposes. It defines a fixed (quantity independent) and variable (quantity dependent) processing time. SMART TABLE (configuration, not context resolution). Key fields: Resource, ResourceType, Model, Step, Product, ProductGroup, Service." .

cm:ResourceRunningMode a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf cm:DataObject ; rdfs:label "Resource Running Mode" ;
    cm:verdict "vendor-extension" ;
    cm:sourceDoc "tables/smart-tables/resourcerunningmode" ;
    rdfs:comment "Used to define the possible running modes for a Resource SMART TABLE (configuration, not context resolution). Key fields: Resource, ResourceType, Model." .

